surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dillom</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>TD</given-names></name><name><surname>Melvin</surname><given-names>IG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Update: The radiographic features of pulmonary tuberculosis</article-title><source>AJR Am J Roentgenol</source><year>1986</year><volume>146</volume><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>506</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3484866</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Washington</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>WT</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Mycobacterial infection in immunocompromised patients</article-title><source>J Thorac Imaging</source><year>1998</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>271</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9799135</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Ku</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Shu</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Fan</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>HY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>YC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The role of chest radiography in the suspicion for and diagnosis of pulmonary tuberculosis in intensive care units</article-title><source>Int J Tuberc Lung Dis</source><year>2009</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>1380</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19861010</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>